        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pigments, paper production, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pigments, paper production, unspecified, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg a mixture of kaolin, calcium carbonate and talc (malusil) according to its use in the European paper industry.;
UUID: 7f9241ad-9cd2-3218-893b-fa5ecf8e0ef9
Mix of the three most used pigments in paper industry - kaolin, calcium carbonate and talcum. Only input of the three mentioned substances
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: data represent a mixture of different pigment materials.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Distribution of the different used pigments according to statistical information. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7f9241ad-9cd2-3218-893b-fa5ecf8e0ef9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
